{"id":"ctabadge","code":"<style>.ctb2{width:290px;text-align:center;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}\n.ctb2 .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);background:var(--card,#171B22);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px 4px 4px;font:600 10px Inter,sans-serif;color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);margin-bottom:14px}\n.ctb2 .badge b{background:var(--accent,#3366FF);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:9px}\n.ctb2 h3{color:var(--ink,#fff);font:800 22px Inter,sans-serif;margin:0 0 6px}\n.ctb2 p{color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:500 11px Inter,sans-serif;margin:0 auto 14px;max-width:32ch;line-height:1.5}\n.ctb2 .btns{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center}.ctb2 a{padding:9px 18px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font:700 12px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}\n.ctb2 .p{background:var(--accent,#3366FF);color:#fff}.ctb2 .g{border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);color:var(--ink,#fff)}</style>\n<div class=\"ctb2\"><span class=\"badge\"><b>New</b>Get started today →</span><h3>Get started with GOOD WORK.</h3><p>Build a fast, animated site that turns visitors into customers.</p><div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"p\">Get started</a><a class=\"g\">Learn more</a></div></div>"}